 233:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****  *   sigma          → raw_sigma[]     (per-mode damping)
 234:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****  *   phi_i          → raw_phi_i[]     (input mode shapes)
 235:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****  *   phi_o          → raw_phi_o_l/r[] (output mode shapes, L & R pickups)
 236:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****  */
