 847:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****     /* ----- Per-mode coefficient loop -----
 848:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      *
 849:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      * MATLAB does this with VECTOR operations:
 850:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      *   sigma_new = sig_0 + sig_1 * beta_stable.^2;   ← scalar + scalar*vector
