 853:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      *   D = phi_i_new              ./ (1+sigma_new*k);
 854:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      *
 855:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      * In C++ we iterate through each mode and compute the scalar
 856:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      * equivalent.  The "./" (element-wise divide) is implemented as
 857:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      * computing the reciprocal once (inv_denom) then multiplying.
 858:PhysPlateReverb.cpp ****      */
